    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present to the market this stunning and ideally located three bedroom, two bathroom end of terrace property with south facing rear garden in the ever popular Silken Park Avenue, Kingswood, Citywest. This sought-after location is within walking distance of a host of local amenities including Citywest shopping centre & Corkagh Park. Transport wise, the Red Luas Line is also within walking distance whilst the major road networks of the N7 & M50 are easily accessible by car.\nBright and spacious living accommodation of c. 110 sq.m can be found here and in brief consists of; Entrance hall, guest wc, fully fitted kitchen/dining room, living room, three double bedrooms and main family bathroom.\nExternally you have a meticulously maintained rear garden which benefits from patio, mature planting and an enviable southerly orientation which is not overlooked. The front boasts off street parking for 3 cars on a cobbelock driveway.\nNo. 70 comes to the market in superb condition throughout and is truly presented in 'walk in' condition. This property was built in 2017 and comes with an exceptionally high energy rating of A2. Due to recent success in the area we know this property will be extremely popular so contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your early interest.\n\nFeatures;\n- c. 110 sq.m\n- 3 BED / 3 BATH\n- A2 BER rating\n- Beautifully maintained SOUTH facing rear garden\n- Turn key condition\n- Modern layout\n- Flooded with natural light\n- Top quality blinds throughout\n- Heaps of built in storage\n- Large driveway for off street parking\n- All essential amenities in close proximity\n- Corkagh Park within minutes\n- Creche and playground within the development\n- Within the catchment area for esteemed local schools\n- Luas within easy reach\n- Immediate access onto N7\n- Ideal for first time buyers, families thinking of trading up and investors\n- Viewing highly advised!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Sales Team 11"
      }
